{"4348940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Emperor", "steam_appid": 4348940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/c41bb85afa8dacb839000aee6631ac25.poster.avif?t=1781102478\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/c41bb85afa8dacb839000aee6631ac25.webm?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/c41bb85afa8dacb839000aee6631ac25.mp4?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Zombie Emperor</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the frenzy for eternal life, Qin Shi Huang's alchemy furnace exploded with forbidden power. The moment the blood moon rose, the border beacons were no longer warnings—they became a call to death. Hun cavalry and Qin soldiers alike crawled up from the dirt, eyes blood-red, flesh rotting, biting and infecting everything alive. Even the once-mighty generals now led the zombie horde as colossal corpse kings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Qin Tie, just a nobody grunt guarding the border. This southernmost stretch of the Great Wall is humanity's last stand. No reinforcements. No retreat. Just endless, increasingly brutal zombie waves slamming into you, wave after wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're changing. Every swing of your blade, every narrow escape—you're stealing some twisted power from those undead bastards. Wounds heal faster, your strength hits harder, your moves get deadlier. You're no hero. You're just the one still breathing.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/5b9de9c9627aaa1614872221b7e69437.poster.avif?t=1781102478\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/5b9de9c9627aaa1614872221b7e69437.webm?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/5b9de9c9627aaa1614872221b7e69437.mp4?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless zombie hordes under the blood moon curse: A nasty mix of barbarian spirits and Eastern corpse poison—each wave smarter, grosser, stronger. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mortal to &quot;undying&quot;: Absorb combat XP to level up your skill tree, unlock new weapons and brutal moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomed vibes with twisted history: Ancient China aesthetics + pure tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival is glory: No endings—just how long you hold out. Leaderboards track longest survival and highest kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenary system: Summon buddies to fight alongside you till the last drop of blood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hold this wall till dawn? Or become the next thing charging over it?<br><br> <strong>Wishlist now and brace for the blood moon.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/c41bb85afa8dacb839000aee6631ac25.poster.avif?t=1781102478\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/c41bb85afa8dacb839000aee6631ac25.webm?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/c41bb85afa8dacb839000aee6631ac25.mp4?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Zombie Emperor</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the frenzy for eternal life, Qin Shi Huang's alchemy furnace exploded with forbidden power. The moment the blood moon rose, the border beacons were no longer warnings—they became a call to death. Hun cavalry and Qin soldiers alike crawled up from the dirt, eyes blood-red, flesh rotting, biting and infecting everything alive. Even the once-mighty generals now led the zombie horde as colossal corpse kings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Qin Tie, just a nobody grunt guarding the border. This southernmost stretch of the Great Wall is humanity's last stand. No reinforcements. No retreat. Just endless, increasingly brutal zombie waves slamming into you, wave after wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're changing. Every swing of your blade, every narrow escape—you're stealing some twisted power from those undead bastards. Wounds heal faster, your strength hits harder, your moves get deadlier. You're no hero. You're just the one still breathing.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/5b9de9c9627aaa1614872221b7e69437.poster.avif?t=1781102478\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/5b9de9c9627aaa1614872221b7e69437.webm?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/extras/5b9de9c9627aaa1614872221b7e69437.mp4?t=1781102478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless zombie hordes under the blood moon curse: A nasty mix of barbarian spirits and Eastern corpse poison—each wave smarter, grosser, stronger. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mortal to &quot;undying&quot;: Absorb combat XP to level up your skill tree, unlock new weapons and brutal moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomed vibes with twisted history: Ancient China aesthetics + pure tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival is glory: No endings—just how long you hold out. Leaderboards track longest survival and highest kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenary system: Summon buddies to fight alongside you till the last drop of blood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hold this wall till dawn? Or become the next thing charging over it?<br><br> <strong>Wishlist now and brace for the blood moon.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A top-down zombie slaughter defense adventure game. Players use skills, talent trees, unique weapons, and weapon upgrades to hold the ultimate defensive line, frantically clearing wave after wave of rotting undead under the blood moon curse. From ordinary Qin soldiers to immortal war gods.", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Thai, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/4ea2414210a9a700ef67451c8b3a2b2cae9e5d41/header.jpg?t=1781102478", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/f0c7aa95016496e34d0f515a3c8012e70a1a2350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781102478", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348940/f0c7aa95016496e34d0f515a3c8012e70a1a2350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781102478", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u